# Kindle prayer-times board - server URL configuration
#
# Copy this file to the Kindle as:
#     /mnt/us/dashboard/board-url.conf
# and edit BOARD_URL so it points at YOUR OWN deployment of the board server
# (see the "Set up your own server" section of the repository README).
#
# The on-device scripts source this file as a POSIX sh fragment, so keep the
# quotes and keep the assignment on one line. No other variables are required.
#
# Correct example:
#     BOARD_URL="https://your-host.example/waktu/board.php"
#
# The value below is only a placeholder. The scripts treat this exact
# placeholder as "not configured" and refuse to fetch anything until you
# change it.

BOARD_URL="https://example.com/waktu/board.php"
